{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HmacSecret"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This extension allows a relying party to derive symmetric keys from a credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"using HMAC-SHA-256 with user-provided salts. The derived keys can be used for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"encryption or other cryptographic operations.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"MakeCredential Usage","anchor":"MakeCredential-Usage","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Request hmac-secret support when creating a credential:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let hmacSecret = CTAP2.Extension.HmacSecret()","let ext = hmacSecret.makeCredential.input()","let params = CTAP2.MakeCredential.Parameters(..., extensions: [ext])","let response = try await session.makeCredential(params)","if let result = try hmacSecret.makeCredential.output(from: response) {","    \/\/ hmac-secret is enabled","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Or derive secrets at registration time (CTAP 2.2 hmac-secret-mc):","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let hmacSecret = try await CTAP2.Extension.HmacSecret(session: session)","let ext = try hmacSecret.makeCredential.input(salt1: salt, salt2: salt2)","let params = CTAP2.MakeCredential.Parameters(..., extensions: [ext])","let response = try await session.makeCredential(params)","if let result = try hmacSecret.makeCredential.output(from: response) {","    switch result {","    case .enabled:","        \/\/ hmac-secret-mc not supported, but hmac-secret is enabled","    case .secrets(let secrets):","        \/\/ Use derived keys (secrets.first, secrets.second)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"GetAssertion Usage","anchor":"GetAssertion-Usage","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Derive keys during authentication:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let hmacSecret = try await CTAP2.Extension.HmacSecret(session: session)","let ext = try hmacSecret.getAssertion.input(salt1: salt)","let params = CTAP2.GetAssertion.Parameters(..., extensions: [ext])","let response = try await session.getAssertion(params)","if let secrets = try hmacSecret.getAssertion.output(from: response) {","    \/\/ Use derived keys (secrets.first, secrets.second)","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/fidoalliance.org\/specs\/fido-v2.2-ps-20250714\/fido-client-to-authenticator-protocol-v2.2-ps-20250714.html#sctn-hmac-secret-extension","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"See Also"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/fidoalliance.org\/specs\/fido-v2.2-ps-20250714\/fido-client-to-authenticator-protocol-v2.2-ps-20250714.html#sctn-hmac-secret-make-cred-extension"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"See Also"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7YubiKit5CTAP2O9ExtensionO10HmacSecretV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"HmacSecret","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"HmacSecret","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"extendedModule":"YubiKit","title":"CTAP2.Extension.HmacSecret","symbolKind":"struct"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Extension"]]},"sections":[],